<p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px;"><span style="font-size:18px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="color:#1c1c1c;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-style:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:400;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text">​</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px;"><span style="font-size:18px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="color:#1c1c1c;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-style:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:400;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Our venison is fairly finely ground, so I minced the onion and parsley nearly into&nbsp;a paste in my food processor before adding it to the meat, bread crumbs and spices. This makes the kofta mixture&nbsp;come together nice and smooth.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px;"><span style="font-size:18px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="color:#1c1c1c;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-style:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:400;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text">​</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px;"><span style="font-size:18px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="color:#1c1c1c;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-style:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:400;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">If you have more coarsely ground meat and a large processor, feel free to combine the whole mixture together in a food&nbsp;processor then remove the mixture to a large bowl and begin making the kofta.</span></span></span></span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-k0pktglf" class="W4V2qg comp-k0pktglf wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="599px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/577c92_63c4ed9172a3423bb921fb746dc56a44~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg/v1/crop/x_0,y_82,w_4032,h_2861/fill/w_599,h_425,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/20190821_183007.jpg 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/577c92_63c4ed9172a3423bb921fb746dc56a44~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg/v1/crop/x_0,y_82,w_4032,h_2861/fill/w_1198,h_850,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/20190821_183007.jpg 2x" id="img_comp-k0pktglf" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/577c92_63c4ed9172a3423bb921fb746dc56a44~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg/v1/crop/x_0,y_82,w_4032,h_2861/fill/w_599,h_425,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/20190821_183007.jpg" alt="Venison Kofta Kebabs" style="object-fit:cover" class="gRkIq0 sFiSiq" width="599" height="425"/></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><wix-iframe id="comp-k0pktgm7" className="comp-k0pktgm7" title="Pin to Pinterest" aria-label="Pin to Pinterest" data-src="https://static.parastorage.com/services/editor-elements-library/dist/thunderbolt/media/pinterestPinIt.587535c5.html?media=https%3A%2F%2Fstatic.wixstatic.com%2Fmedia%2F577c92_63c4ed9172a3423bb921fb746dc56a44%7Emv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.theglasspantry.com&amp;description=Venison+Kofta+Kebabs&amp;data-pin-do=buttonBookmark&amp;data-pin-config=none&amp;data-pin-color=gray&amp;data-pin-height=20"><iframe title="Pin to Pinterest" aria-label="Pin to Pinterest" data-src="https://static.parastorage.com/services/editor-elements-library/dist/thunderbolt/media/pinterestPinIt.587535c5.html?media=https%3A%2F%2Fstatic.wixstatic.com%2Fmedia%2F577c92_63c4ed9172a3423bb921fb746dc56a44%7Emv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.theglasspantry.com&amp;description=Venison+Kofta+Kebabs&amp;data-pin-do=buttonBookmark&amp;data-pin-config=none&amp;data-pin-color=gray&amp;data-pin-height=20" scrolling="no" style="width:100%;height:100%"></iframe></wix-iframe><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-k0pktgnm" class="comp-k0pktgnm"></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-k0pktgoc" style="display:none"></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-k0pktgp3" class="UwkEpO _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-k0pktgp3 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px;"><span style="font-size:18px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">To form the kebabs, take a large ball&nbsp;of the meat mixture with your hand and mold it on a wooden skewer. </span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px;">&nbsp;</p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px;"><span style="font-size:18px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">When using wooden skewers, always soak them in water for 30-60 minutes before you begin adding ingredients to them to keep them from burning up while you&#39;re grilling. I usually add them to water first thing while preparing kebabs.</span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:14px;">&nbsp;</p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:14px;">&nbsp;</p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-k0pktgps" class="W4V2qg comp-k0pktgps wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="740px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/577c92_2a3682f61e6c4ca78900526d50e748f0~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg/v1/fill/w_740,h_550,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/20190821_183303.jpg 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/577c92_2a3682f61e6c4ca78900526d50e748f0~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg/v1/fill/w_1480,h_1100,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/20190821_183303.jpg 2x" id="img_comp-k0pktgps" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/577c92_2a3682f61e6c4ca78900526d50e748f0~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg/v1/fill/w_740,h_550,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/20190821_183303.jpg" alt="Venison Kofta Kebabs" style="object-fit:cover" class="gRkIq0 sFiSiq" width="740" height="550"/></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><wix-iframe id="comp-k0pktgqo" className="comp-k0pktgqo" title="Pin to Pinterest" aria-label="Pin to Pinterest" data-src="https://static.parastorage.com/services/editor-elements-library/dist/thunderbolt/media/pinterestPinIt.587535c5.html?media=https%3A%2F%2Fstatic.wixstatic.com%2Fmedia%2F577c92_2a3682f61e6c4ca78900526d50e748f0%7Emv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.theglasspantry.com&amp;description=Venison+Kofta+Kebabs&amp;data-pin-do=buttonBookmark&amp;data-pin-config=none&amp;data-pin-color=gray&amp;data-pin-height=20"><iframe title="Pin to Pinterest" aria-label="Pin to Pinterest" data-src="https://static.parastorage.com/services/editor-elements-library/dist/thunderbolt/media/pinterestPinIt.587535c5.html?media=https%3A%2F%2Fstatic.wixstatic.com%2Fmedia%2F577c92_2a3682f61e6c4ca78900526d50e748f0%7Emv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.theglasspantry.com&amp;description=Venison+Kofta+Kebabs&amp;data-pin-do=buttonBookmark&amp;data-pin-config=none&amp;data-pin-color=gray&amp;data-pin-height=20" scrolling="no" style="width:100%;height:100%"></iframe></wix-iframe><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-k0pktgrj" class="UwkEpO _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-k0pktgrj wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px;"><span style="font-size:18px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="color:#1c1c1c;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-style:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:400;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Place the kofta kebabs on the lightly oiled, heated&nbsp;grill. </span></span></span></span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-k0pktgsf" class="W4V2qg comp-k0pktgsf wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="740px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/577c92_7dc0ff459ca946b6b21d83ee0b30ebea~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg/v1/fill/w_740,h_530,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/20190821_185316.jpg 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/577c92_7dc0ff459ca946b6b21d83ee0b30ebea~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg/v1/fill/w_1480,h_1060,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/20190821_185316.jpg 2x" id="img_comp-k0pktgsf" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/577c92_7dc0ff459ca946b6b21d83ee0b30ebea~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg/v1/fill/w_740,h_530,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/20190821_185316.jpg" alt="Venison Kofta Kebabs" style="object-fit:cover" class="gRkIq0 sFiSiq" width="740" height="530"/></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-k1b573z5" class="UwkEpO _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-k1b573z5 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px;"><span style="font-size:18px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="color:#1c1c1c;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-style:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:400;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">We use&nbsp;a Green Mountain Grill to smoke&nbsp;the kebabs for about 10 minutes on each side at 375 degrees before moving them to a searing (gas)grill to finish them (about 4 minutes per side). You can also use a gas grill only and cook them for 4-6 minutes per side.</span></span></span></span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-k1b55fs6" class="W4V2qg comp-k1b55fs6 wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="755px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/577c92_1c3a51eb69a94b09afd3e1db41c36246~mv2_d_2973_2230_s_2.jpg/v1/fill/w_755,h_555,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/20190821_185753.jpg 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/577c92_1c3a51eb69a94b09afd3e1db41c36246~mv2_d_2973_2230_s_2.jpg/v1/fill/w_1510,h_1110,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/20190821_185753.jpg 2x" id="img_comp-k1b55fs6" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/577c92_1c3a51eb69a94b09afd3e1db41c36246~mv2_d_2973_2230_s_2.jpg/v1/fill/w_755,h_555,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/20190821_185753.jpg" alt="20190821_185753.jpg" style="object-fit:cover" class="gRkIq0 sFiSiq" width="755" height="555"/></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-k0pktgvo" class="UwkEpO _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-k0pktgvo wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h5 class="font_5 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px;"><span style="font-size:18px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="color:#1c1c1c;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-style:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:400;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">I serve the kofta kebabs&nbsp;with pita bread, tahini sauce, sliced onions, tomatoes and more fresh parsley.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></h5>

<h5 class="font_5 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px;"><span style="font-size:18px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="color:#1c1c1c;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-style:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:400;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text">​</span></span></span></span></span></span></h5>

<h5 class="font_5 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px;"><span style="font-size:18px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="color:#1c1c1c;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-style:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:400;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">If you like bold flavors this is your dish!&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></h5>

